      <p>To provision {"{"}{"{"} hcp {"}"}{"}"} on bare-metal infrastructure, you can use the Agent platform. The Agent platform uses the central infrastructure management service to add compute nodes to a hosted cluster. For more information, see "Enabling the central infrastructure management service".</p>
